    { "type": "text", "id": "gate_text", "x": 610, "y": 145, "width": 340, "height": 290, "text": "AuthGate 동작\n\nuseUser() {isLoaded, isSignedIn}\n\n1. isSignedIn=true → children\n2. isLoaded=false & <2s → 스피너\n3. isLoaded=false & ≥2s → 게이트 (fallback)\n4. isLoaded=true & !isSignedIn → 게이트\n\nFIX 2026-05-17:\n2초 타임아웃 추가\n(이전: ~20s 스피너 멈춤)", "originalText": "AuthGate 동작\n\nuseUser() {isLoaded, isSignedIn}\n\n1. isSignedIn=true → children\n2. isLoaded=false & <2s → 스피너\n3. isLoaded=false & ≥2s → 게이트 (fallback)\n4. isLoaded=true & !isSignedIn → 게이트\n\nFIX 2026-05-17:\n2초 타임아웃 추가\n(이전: ~20s 스피너 멈춤)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "middle", "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 20075, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 20076, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "gate_box", "lineHeight": 1.4 },

